    "text": "18 hours ago As Mark Logullo would say—His final lap around the sun came to an end on Sept. 1, 2025. Mark was born in Chicago but moved to Huntington Beach, California, as a young boy, where he spent his childhood and youth. While Mark loved to tell stories of his times as a beach boy, his mother had told him, “Oh Marko, you were born 150 years too late. You were meant to be a mountain man;” and a mountain man he became. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
